      players: 'Two or more players.',
      deck: 'Standard 52-card French deck. Spades may also be played with one or two Jokers or with predetermined cards removed; with six or more players a second deck is often used.',
      equipment: 'Standard 52-card French deck. Spades may also be played with one or two Jokers or with predetermined cards removed; with six or more players a second deck is often used.',
